WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.598
Magppie is not, in the end, a kitchen company.

1.2
00:00:04.598 --> 00:00:09.196
It is a wellness company that happens to build kitchens.

2.1
00:00:09.196 --> 00:00:14.442
Our mission is to transform ordinary homes into wellness homes.

2.2
00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:19.688
Spaces that keep you, your family, and the planet safe.

3.1
00:00:19.688 --> 00:00:26.607
Magppie launched in two thousand, bringing steel, and later stone-based design, to Indian homes.

3.2
00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:33.526
By two thousand and seven it had gone global, across more than thirty-five countries.

3.3
00:00:33.526 --> 00:00:40.445
In twenty twenty-three came the Wellness Kitchen — the world’s first hundred per cent stone modular kitchen.

3.4
00:00:40.445 --> 00:00:47.364
And in February twenty twenty-six, recognition at the K B I S Innovation Hour in Orlando.

4.1
00:00:47.364 --> 00:00:52.965
The difference is the material.

4.2
00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:58.567
A Magppie kitchen is built from engineered stone rather than wood.

4.3
00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:04.168
There is nothing for termites to eat, nothing that swells when it gets wet, and no formaldehyde released into the room where you cook.

5.1
00:01:04.168 --> 00:01:11.372
It is built by a team working across India, the United States, Europe and Denmark.

6.1
00:01:11.372 --> 00:01:15.469
The objective is simple to say, and hard to do.

6.2
00:01:15.469 --> 00:01:19.567
Make an ordinary home a place that actively looks after the people living in it.

6.3
00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:23.664
That is the work.

